# Dynamic export list for binaries that embed the static CPython (ld64).
# Consumed as `-Wl,-exported_symbols_list,<this file>`.
#
# Mach-O prefixes C symbols with an underscore, so these are the same three
# patterns as cpython.dynamic-list with that prefix applied: `Py*` -> `_Py*`,
# `_Py*` -> `__Py*`, `PY_*` -> `_PY_*`. Keep the two files in step; the
# rationale for the symbol set lives in cpython.dynamic-list.
_Py*
__Py*
_PY_*
